# Vendored AR libraries di-gate pakai sha256 (scripts/check-vendor.mjs) terhadap
# byte asli upstream, yang pakai LF. Tanpa aturan ini, checkout di Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true) nulis ulang file-nya jadi CRLF -> checksum meleset ->
# `npm run build` gagal di gate, padahal isinya nggak diapa-apain.
# `-text` = jangan pernah konversi EOL, di platform mana pun.
public/vendor/** -text
